# Leering Onlooker: "{2}{B}{B}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create two tapped 1/1 black Bat creature tokens with flying." (CR 602.2, 602.5, 118.3) The cost is the mana and the exile: with only three
# mana available the activation from the graveyard is refused (the Onlooker stays there), and once the fourth mana is there it is paid and the Bats appear.

